; ===========================================================================
; NORMALS
; Every attack states its own `juggle`. That number is what the engine
; charges the opponent's juggle points when it lands on somebody already
; falling, and cns.html is explicit that an attack with no value of its own
; simply keeps whatever the last one used - so leaving them out makes a jab
; cost as much as a super.
; ===========================================================================

